$ nova-sprint
nova-sprint deals cards to AIs over nova-bus, reads them, and lands them. It stands on nova-tools.
NEXT the fleet is not up: nova-fleet check reports tailscale, redis, postgres missing
next: nova-fleet check
$ nova-sprint
NEXT nova-tools is up; the sprint is not set up
next: nova-sprint up --as rowan
$ nova-sprint up --as rowan
UP 1/8 nova-tools: fleet green; nova-tools v2.0.0 at or above pin v2.0.0: VERIFIED
UP 2/8 store: schema sprint version 2 and backup: VERIFIED
UP 3/8 coordinator rowan: not hooked
SPRINT REFUSED up: rowan is not hooked in: run nova-bus hook --as rowan under your session's Monitor tool
$ nova-sprint stream add docs --repo owner/repo
STREAM ADDED docs repo=owner/repo base=main branch=sprint/docs
next: nova-sprint add --stream docs --brief-file <file>
$ nova-sprint add --stream docs --brief-file card
ADDED fix-typos stream=docs tier=pro priority=normal needs=-
next: nothing; wait for the bus
$ nova-sprint take fix-typos.w1@0 --as worker --epoch 1
TAKEN fix-typos.w1 repo=owner/repo base=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa branch=sprint/docs/fix-typos
Fix the typos.
next: nova-sprint finish fix-typos.w1@1 --head <sha> --as worker --epoch 1
$ nova-sprint finish fix-typos.w1@1 --head bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb --as worker --epoch 1
FINISHED fix-typos.w1 head=bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb applied at seq 8
next: nothing; wait for the bus
$ nova-sprint take fix-typos.r1.1@0 --as reader --epoch 1
TAKEN fix-typos.r1.1 repo=owner/repo head=bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb
Read detached at this head; do not edit or push.
Fix the typos.
next: nova-sprint read fix-typos.r1.1@1 yes|fix --as reader --epoch 1
$ nova-sprint read fix-typos.r1.1@1 yes --as reader --epoch 1
READ fix-typos.r1.1 head=bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb result=ok applied at seq 11
next: nothing; wait for the bus
